OpenCPN 5.14.2 for AmigaOS 3: the world basemap on the first paint.
- shapefile_basemap: the basemap loads on its own thread (std::async) and
  draws nothing until it is in, and nothing draws the canvas again when it
  is, so the chart showed sea only until the view changed. IsLoading() says
  when a load is still running.
- chcanv.cpp: a canvas drawn while it was loading sets g_basemap_redraw.
- ocpn_frame.cpp: the one-second frame timer reloads and repaints the
  canvases once the load is done.

